    "text": "<p>For the reaction<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />the magnitude of the standard molar free energy change, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo></math>______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi></math> (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p><img height=\"81\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/25322c0c-f583-44c3-898c-7021b2474158-image.png\" width=\"408\" /></p>",
    "image": null
